---
import Button from "../shared/Button.astro";
---

<section class="px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:py-32">
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
		<!-- Text Column -->
		<div data-reveal="left">
			<span class="inline-block rounded-sm border border-gold/30 bg-navy-light/80 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">
				Sobre o Grupo US
			</span>

			<h2 class="mt-6 font-serif text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-text-primary md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
				Liderado por quem vive a{" "}
				<span class="text-gold">transformacao</span>
			</h2>

			<p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted md:text-lg">
				Sob a lideranca da Dra. Sacha Gualberto, o Grupo US nasceu com um
				proposito claro: transformar profissionais da saude em referencias,
				unindo tecnica, gestao e comunidade. Com mais de 5.000 profissionais
				impactados em 26 estados e 10 paises, construimos o ecossistema mais
				completo de educacao em saude estetica do Brasil.
			</p>

			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted md:text-lg">
				Nossa visao e ser o ecossistema mais completo em Saude e Negocios
				globalmente, formando profissionais que nao apenas dominam a tecnica,
				mas que tambem lideram com estrategia e impacto.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-8">
				<Button variant="outline" href="/sobre">
					Conheca nossa historia
				</Button>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Image Placeholder Column -->
		<div data-reveal="right">
			<div class="relative mx-auto aspect-[3/4] w-full max-w-md overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gold/10 bg-navy-light lg:max-w-none">
				<!-- Decorative gradient overlay -->
				<div
					class="absolute inset-0"
					style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-gold) 5%, transparent) 0%, transparent 50%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-navy-lighter) 20%, transparent) 100%);"
					aria-hidden="true"
				></div>

				<!-- Placeholder text -->
				<div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 p-8 text-center">
					<div class="h-16 w-16 rounded-full border-2 border-gold/30 bg-navy-lighter/50" aria-hidden="true"></div>
					<span class="text-sm font-medium text-text-muted">
						Foto Dra. Sacha Gualberto
					</span>
					<span class="text-xs text-text-muted/60">
						CEO &mdash; Grupo US
					</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
